  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation Nexus Skills Jobs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A recent study has identified the obstacles to the Agricultural and Rural Training (ART) to be an essential leverage for the agricultural sector. The Embassy of the Netherlands in Niger aims to contribute to sustainable strengthening of the quality of trainers in Agricultural and Rural Training (ART) in Niger via a multi-annual intervention.This project will identify the outline of such a concrete multi-annual project based on where it can have the most impact and inventorise potential structures to implement it.</narrative>
  </description>
